---
manual: events.hover_leave_example
lines: [2167, 2185]
testability: interactive
display: native
expect: fail
reason: Lacci makes hover and leave children of the slot, so the hover block's s.clear destroys the leave handler and the background stays blue (ledger row requested)
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  s = stack width: 200, height: 200 do
    background red
    hover do
      s.clear { background blue }
    end
    leave do
      s.clear { background red }
    end
  end
end
----------- test code
move_mouse 100, 100
assert_equal [0, 0, 255, 255], pixel_at(100, 100), "blue while the mouse is inside"

move_mouse 300, 100
assert_equal [255, 0, 0, 255], pixel_at(100, 100), "the mouse floated away, so the background is red again"
